Value INTERFACE ([\w.-]+(?:\s+\d+(?:/\d+)*(?:\.\d+)?)?|\S+)
Value STATUS (up|down|administratively down|\S+)
Value ADMIN_STATUS (up|down|\S+)
Value DESCRIPTION (.*)

Start
  ^Interface\s+Status\s+Administrative\s+Description
  ^-+
  ^${INTERFACE}\s{2,}${STATUS}\s{2,}${ADMIN_STATUS}\s{2,}${DESCRIPTION}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${STATUS}\s+${ADMIN_STATUS}\s+${DESCRIPTION}\s*$$ -> Record
